  <!-- Gaslight gauntlets (carving spec closed 2026-09-29). Hands, tier 4, 1 AV / 0 DV, metal
       (user). Tile = base plastifer gloves, green with yellow detail (user). Gaslight family
       conventions from the base Gaslight Chisel: cell socket, charged-only light radius 4,
       Examiner complexity 4, Tinker bits 0004, commerce 120. Weight 3 matches plastifer.
       Behavior in Part_GaslightGauntlets.cs. Description user text 2026-09-29. -->
